    "title": "com.sap.xsapp.schema_8.2",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "description": "The application router will serve **index.html** as the welcome file and uses a **route\u2011based authentication** method with a session timeout of **1800\u202fseconds**. All plugin metadata can be accessed at **/meta**. Compression is turned on for responses larger than **1024\u202fbytes**, while WebSocket support is disabled. A whitelist service is exposed at the relative path **/whitelist**.  \n\nTwo routing rules are defined. The first matches any request whose path starts with **/api/** (regex \u201c^/api/.*\u201d) for the HTTP methods **GET** and **POST**; such requests are forwarded to **/backend**, CSRF protection is enabled, and the route requires **xsuaa** authentication through the identity provider **my-idp**. Authorization scopes are configured as follows: **GET** requests need the **ReadScope**, **POST** requests require both **WriteScope** and **AdminScope**, and any other method falls back to **DefaultScope**. Before forwarding, the router will replace the path suffixes \u201c.html\u201d and \u201c.js\u201d, substituting the variables **var1** and **var2** (no additional services are injected), and the response header will include **Cache\u2011Control: no\u2011cache**.  \n\nThe second rule serves static content: any path matching \u201c^/static/.*\u201d via **GET** is served from the local directory **public**, with a **Cache\u2011Control** header of **max-age=3600**. Destination **MyDest** logs out via **POST** to **/logout**, while **AnotherDest** uses a **GET** to **/signout**. The defined service **MyService** points to **https://service.example.com**, logging out with a **GET** to **/slogout**. For overall logout handling, the router redirects to **/logout** and shows the page **https://example.com/logout.html**; login callbacks are expected at **/callback**. Finally, custom error pages are provided: a 404 error displays **error/404.html**, and the error codes **500** and **502** share the page **error/5xx.html**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "welcomeFile": "index.html",
    "authenticationMethod": "route",
    "sessionTimeout": 1800,
    "pluginMetadataEndpoint": "/meta",
    "routes": [
      {
        "source": "^/api/.*",
        "httpMethods": [
          "GET",
          "POST"
        ],
        "target": "/backend",
        "csrfProtection": true,
        "authenticationType": "xsuaa",
        "identityProvider": "my-idp",
        "scope": {
          "GET": "ReadScope",
          "POST": [
            "WriteScope",
            "AdminScope"
          ],
          "default": "DefaultScope"
        },
        "replace": {
          "pathSuffixes": [
            ".html",
            ".js"
          ],
          "vars": [
            "var1",
            "var2"
          ],
          "services": {}
        },
        "cacheControl": "no-cache"
      },
      {
        "source": "^/static/.*",
        "httpMethods": [
          "GET"
        ],
        "localDir": "public",
        "cacheControl": "max-age=3600"
      }
    ],
    "destinations": {
      "MyDest": {
        "logoutPath": "/logout",
        "logoutMethod": "POST"
      },
      "AnotherDest": {
        "logoutPath": "/signout",
        "logoutMethod": "GET"
      }
    },
    "services": {
      "MyService": {
        "endpoint": "https://service.example.com",
        "logoutPath": "/slogout",
        "logoutMethod": "GET"
      }
    },
    "logout": {
      "logoutEndpoint": "/logout",
      "logoutPage": "https://example.com/logout.html"
    },
    "login": {
      "callbackEndpoint": "/callback"
    },
    "whitelistService": {
      "endpoint": "/whitelist"
    },
    "compression": {
      "enabled": true,
      "minSize": 1024
    },
    "websockets": {
      "enabled": false
    },
    "errorPage": [
      {
        "status": 404,
        "file": "error/404.html"
      },
      {
        "status": [
          500,
          502
        ],
        "file": "error/5xx.html"
      }
    ]
  }
}